cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software and the paper below."
title: "AffKernel: single-pass, NMS-free affordance segmentation for real-time robotic manipulation"
abstract: >-
  AffKernel couples RT-DETR object queries with a CondInst-style per-query
  dynamic-convolution kernel that decodes per-object affordance masks from a
  single shared high-resolution affordance map. Inference is single-pass,
  NMS-free and deterministic, running at 42 FPS while reaching a weighted
  F-measure of 0.868 on IIT-AFF.
type: software
authors:
